From f576205fac484955ce7ec6c69eec06d4e6ec4d84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:04:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Item menus: players.open-item-menu (round 4 item 2, API 48)

A mod opens one of its declared menu types over a player's slot; every slot
is virtual and goes back to the player on close. item-menu-tick sets slots,
data and strings each tick, item-menu-button and item-menu-taken answer the
buttons and result takes, text boxes carry (i32::MIN, 1, slot). The menu
closes when the slot no longer holds the item or the mod says close.
Example item-menu-demo; harness steps and checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
